videos anymore so  the guys had to provide snarky  commentary on mtv reality shows like  jersey shore unfortunately the new  beavis and butt head lasted just one  season it wasn't all bad news for mike  judge in the world of tv though he would  go on to create the hit hbo series  silicon valley in 2014.  in the summer of 2019 beavis and  butthead creator mike judge revealed to  slash film that another movie may be on  the horizon judge said i think it would  have to be something that makes it  relevant today i think i might have  figured out a way to do that indeed it  would seem that he figured it out  paramount the parent company of mtv  announced in 2022 that before the year  was out a new movie featuring the stupid  twosome would hit its streaming service  paramount plus  according to the rap beavis and butthead  do the universe the spiritual successor  to 1996's big screen beavis and butthead  to america was described by paramount as  perhaps the dumbest space movie ever  made beginning in 1998 a judge with a  penchant for creative sentencing orders  beavis and butthead to attend space camp  from there the pair accidentally makes  their way onto the space shuttle then  deep into the cosmos before eventually  falling through a black hole and  returning to earth in the 2020s of  course the movie will also serve as a  launch pad to an entire new season of  the beavis and butthead tv series  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

